    "show_share": true,
    "description": "It is with deep sorrow that we announce the demise of an invaluable member and cornerstone of the AKU family, Distinguished University Professor Emeritus Dr Cameruddin Vellani. He was not only a legendary clinician but also an inspiring teacher, visionary leader, and pioneer of medical education in Pakistan. He is survived by his wife Sayeda, daughters Zulaikha and Ayesha, and son Amir.",
